#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/op/gemm/gemm_tcgen05_blockscaled/index.rst:62
msgid ""
"Follows the same completion protocol as the dense TCGEN05 lowering: the "
"synchronous `T.gemm_blockscaled` posts completion to `mbar` and waits on it "
"right after issue, while the explicit `is_tcgen05` op never waits and may "
"omit `mbar` when the caller or WS schedule emits a later completion arrival."
msgstr ""
